Package: crossLagR
Type: Package
Title: Latent variable models for estimating cross-lagged effects in R 
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Christopher Weber
Maintainer: Christopher Weber <chrisweber@arizona.edu>
Description: This package accompanies Weber et al (2024) and contains the functions used to generate the results in the paper. The package wraps lavaan to build and fit panel-data SEM models (CLPM, RI-CLPM, latent change score, and related estimators). The package also contains the data used in the paper.
